      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "time   unix seconds UTC          distance  km, km/s           flux  W/m2         field  nT\nangles heliographic degrees: lat north +, lon west +, (0,0) = point facing Earth\n\nshared and physics never import from an app.   Any number the UI shows that the server also\ncomputes comes from physics - so the drawn CME front reaches Earth exactly at the server's eta.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8351719,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "time   unix seconds UTC          distance  km, km/s           flux  W/m2         field  nT\nangles heliographic degrees: lat north +, lon west +, (0,0) = point facing Earth\n\nshared and physics never import from an app.   Any number the UI shows that the server also\ncomputes comes from physics - so the drawn CME front reaches Earth exactly at the server's eta.",
      "textAlign": "left",
